; ted-screenopen-cfail-a6 (#382): screenopen's failure paths behind
; OpenScreen (.cfail, .wfail) call `jsr closescreen(a6)` with a6 =
; ExecBase: exec's LVO -66 instead of intuition's CloseScreen.  TED alone
; under inject: the character map's AllocMem (chcols 128 x edrows 28 =
; 3584 bytes of chip memory on the session's Workbench) fails, the start
; fails.  Correct: the screen is closed (teddrive logs it) and TED ends;
; the original calls into exec with a0 = the screen and crashes (the
; session hangs).
; @source none
; @command TEDAB:tools/inject allocfail=3584-3584/chip/1 blitz2:ted
; @expect stdout "inject: allocfail: 1 allocations failed"
; @expect log "screen closed"
timeout 20
wait exit
